		<img height="366" src="../img/kyusyubook1_small.jpg" width="378" /></a><a href="../img/kyusyubook2.jpg"><img height="382" src="../img/kyusyubook2_small.jpg" width="378" /></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">&nbsp;</td></tr>
